---
title: Team Application
tableOfContents: true
---
If you are interested in joining the team, follow these instructions carefully.

- Head to our [Discord](https://discord.gg/CQnkc5gS6a), or join if you haven't already.
- Go to the #roles channel and get the @Applicant role.
- Elizabeth Bot will ping you in a private channel that only you and team leads can see.
- Click the link to the Team Application form in Elizabeth Bot's message.
- Fill out the application.
- Wait for the respective team lead to review your application.

If you were rejected, feel free to reapply at a later date.

If you were accepted:

- A team lead will grant you the respective team role on Discord.
- You will be added to the GitHub org, and optionally you can request to be added to the Google Drive.
- You must read the [general onboarding](/guides/onboardings/general-onboarding/) & your team-specific onboarding document (MANDATORY).
